{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5937fb3b811dec66a60d6154f85e7f0550f83e52441571555f4b136b7a7097f4", "ja": "伊織、ブログ更新してくれて、ありがとうな。\nおかげでアクセス数がぐんぐん伸びてるぞ！", "zh": "伊织，谢谢你费心去更新部落格。\n托你的福，点阅数可是直线上升喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "f3cfcbfcf59b439a5dd0f5d44f0dec5a7847033d407a99b96bf5202cd57111d4", "ja": "あらそう。ま、伊織ちゃんからの貴重なメッセージを\n受け取れるんだもの。当然よね～♪", "zh": "哎呀，是喔？这也难怪，毕竟能收到\n伊织给的贵重讯息，会这样是当然的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "6da74cf3c662fd658722ceee280fe684d6d00b96252744fa342af6c4dc58bc9b", "ja": "で、アンタの顔がいつにもましてキモいのは、\nそのせいなワケ？", "zh": "所以，你的表情看起来比平时还要恶心，\n就是因为这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1003_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "4ed945de942e00301cc6eb288ad4c025cf96c17683dde8a39c46e38c33f33715", "ja": "なんかニヤニヤしてて、気持ち悪いわ……。\n劇場の子たちに逃げられないよう、気をつけなさい。", "zh": "一直笑嘻嘻的，真叫人反胃……\n你小心别把剧场的偶像们吓跑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "572573650339284b362042e8f2d5e16684eb4872ed52d2dd7bcd288e5f2c356f", "ja": "そ、そうか……自然と笑っちゃってたのかな。\nまあ、教えてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "这、这样啊……我应该是不自觉地笑出来了。\n嗯，谢谢你提醒我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5961b07e914eea32e575c24a3ce055ea141427d75adc39900495c09659e54fcf", "ja": "でも、笑ってたのは別に、\nアクセス数が増えたせいじゃないんだ。", "zh": "不过，我笑并不是因为访客数增加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "e78f262d1125ee2570ae69b8c89ac057cbe05bb65eb418440a4f6784bbf3ea1f", "ja": "あら、そうなの？　じゃあ、\nどうしてニヤニヤして……あっ！", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗？\n那你为什么一直笑嘻嘻的……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "1f4056090410989b01f3352c435856bc42f860be5fa6ddb6bab3a282c1564400", "ja": "さてはアンタ、私の着替えをのぞいてたのね！？\nこの変態！　いますぐ捕まりなさい！！", "zh": "想必是你偷窥我换衣服吧！？\n你这变态！给我立刻束手就擒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b941cafa946e7ff013f0b3084d1102accb8ebfbef99a6b7ee7a0ed0ad92491f2", "ja": "のぞいてないって！\nただ、伊織のブログ内容が嬉しかっただけだよ。", "zh": "我没有偷窥啦！\n我只是看了伊织发的文觉得很高兴而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c69c53f14f2f97ddcd7df860ac34f8d9764b348a835753c6c5e5c7b8d1afe02b", "ja": "月見のことも、PVのことも、その衣装のことも、\n全部気に入ってくれたみたいだったし……。", "zh": "赏月、PV，还有那套服装，\n你好像都很喜欢的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1b6e3a15af6d6e51ac167b4922f4ca63303a6ccf0d33dae882769b8fd2cc9acb", "ja": "それを、しっかりファンに伝えてくれたことも\n良かったかな。しっかり目標が見えてる感じで。", "zh": "我很高兴看到你将这些分享给粉丝们，\n给人一种目标很明确的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "cac0eb048d37eaa26fc2d48b1b8de55193f374d55c7870839f40645d295d12e4", "ja": "そ……、そうなの。ふーん。\nちゃんと読んでくれてるのね……。", "zh": "这……这样啊。\n哼～看来你是真的有仔细在看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "25443897626f2cb215aff9d2868dbe8471915057b42f51a1f2fc89a559c8aeb2", "ja": "そうよ。PVも衣装も、どんなに素敵でも、\nファンに見てもらわないと意味ないんだから。", "zh": "没错，不管PV还是服装再美再棒，\n不让粉丝看到就没有意义。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "2d4be7d4cab083f43a2239e989cc84b75a2c4711006b9fa59c1299e9f86bf443", "ja": "せっかくいいモノができたんだし、今のファンだけに\n見せて終わったんじゃ、もったいないわ。", "zh": "费尽心思完成一个好作品，\n却只让现在的粉丝看到，实在太浪费了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d6964572ee0bfc3c5be836515a15de62bf72ff8d0243b0b51cb00e18bddba000", "ja": "ああ、できるだけたくさんの人に\n見てもらえるよう、頑張っていこう！", "zh": "说得对，我们一起加油，\n努力让更多的人都能看见吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "bf37a1a6e451e22626854a5bdc470b1fde85d7db21155b367953af0944f59069", "ja": "いっとくけど、今の10倍とか100倍程度の人数じゃ、\n全然足りないわよ？", "zh": "我先声明，人数如果只有现在的十倍百倍，\n我可不会满足喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0084_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "cd5342ab8a2e8bbe4631c7ef50bb05c8dd9c24480fa10ac95dade9627c594a65", "ja": "10万倍、100万倍の人数に見せつけられるまで！\nアンタもしっかり働きなさいよねっ。にひひっ♪", "zh": "直到被十万倍、百万倍的人看见为止！\n你也要好好奋斗喔，咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
